      "name": "ClearFrameDecodedBytesCounter",
      "signature": "void ClearFrameDecodedBytesCounter(uint * pFrameInfo)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Clears the decoded bytes counter field in the JPEG frame info structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Access frame info structure at offset 0xC (field index 3)\n2. Set the field to zero, resetting the decoded bytes count\n\nParameters:\n    pFrameInfo (uint*) - IN: Pointer to JPEG frame information structure\n\nReturns:\n    void\n\nStructure Layout:\n    Offset  Size  Field              Description\n    0x0C    4     dwDecodedBytes     Bytes decoded counter (reset to 0)\n\nNotes:\n    Called by DecodeJpegScanDispatch on successful decode completion to\n    reset the frame's decoded bytes counter before the next scan pass.",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
