      "name": "DetectJpegColorSpaceMode",
      "signature": "undefined4 DetectJpegColorSpaceMode(int param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Detects JPEG color space and subsampling mode from component configuration.\n\nAnalyzes the JPEG context structure to determine the appropriate color space\nmode based on component count, horizontal/vertical sampling factors, and\nother configuration flags. Sets the detected mode at offset 0x18.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize color space mode to 0 (unknown)\n2. Check if processing is disabled (offset 0x74 != 0) - return early\n3. Check progressive mode flag (offset 0x6c) and baseline flag (offset 0x68)\n4. Read component count from offset 0x37c0 (valid range: 1-255)\n5. For 3 components (YCbCr):\n   a. Check sampling factors from component info array (offset 0x37cc)\n   b. Determine mode based on horizontal/vertical sampling ratios\n6. For 4 components (CMYK):\n   a. Verify 5 samples_per_line and 4 color components\n   b. Validate uniform 2:2 or 1:1 sampling across all components\n7. For grayscale with 4 components: verify all 1:1 sampling\n\nParameters:\nnJpegContextAddr - Address of JPEG decoder context structure (passed as int)\n\nReturns:\n0 on success (mode stored at nJpegContextAddr+0x18)\n-14 (0xFFFFFFF2) if component count is invalid (not in range 1-255)\n\nColor Space Mode Values (stored at offset 0x18):\n0x03 = YCbCr 4:2:2 (3 comp, h_samp=1, Y:2x2, Cb:1x1, Cr:1x1)\n0x04 = YCbCr 4:2:0 (3 comp, h_samp=2, Y:2x2, Cb:1x1, Cr:1x1)\n0x05 = YCbCr 4:4:4 (3 comp, h_samp=1, Y:1x1 sampling for all)\n0x06 = YCbCr variant (3 comp, h_samp=2, Y:1x1 sampling for all)\n0x0B = CMYK (4 comp, Y:2x2, others:1x1, K:2x2)\n0x0E = Grayscale-like (4 comp, all 1x1 sampling)\n\nStructure Layout (JPEG Context offsets):\nOffset  Size  Field                  Description\n0x18    4     nColorSpaceMode        Output: detected color space mode\n0x30    4     nColorComponents       Number of color components\n0x34    4     nSamplesPerLine        Samples per line (image width related)\n0x68    4     fBaselineMode          Non-zero if baseline DCT mode\n0x6c    4     fProgressiveMode       Non-zero if progressive mode\n0x74    4     fProcessingDisabled    Non-zero if processing disabled\n0x37C0  4     nComponentCount        Total number of image components (1-255)\n0x37CC  4     pComponentInfoArray    Pointer to component sampling info array\n\nComponent Info Array Structure (16 bytes per component):\nOffset  Size  Field         Description\n0x04    4     nHSampFactor  Horizontal sampling factor\n0x08    4     nVSampFactor  Vertical sampling factor",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
