      "name": "DispatchImagePlaneProcessor",
      "signature": "undefined DispatchImagePlaneProcessor(int param_1, int param_2, int * param_3, int param_4, uint param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Dispatches image plane processing to the appropriate decoder based on colorspace type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if special fast-path conditions are met (pPlaneData[0x74] set and context[0x4de0] clear)\n2. If fast-path, call ProcessImagePlanes directly with single-plane mode\n3. Otherwise, check colorspace type from pPlaneData[0x18]:\n   - Type 0: Fall through to subsampling/block processor selection\n   - Type 3: RGB 24-bit (16x16 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeRgb888\n   - Type 4: RGBA 32-bit (16x16 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeRgba8888\n   - Type 1: Grayscale 8-bit (8x8 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeGrayscale8\n   - Type 2: Grayscale+Alpha 16-bit (8x8 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeGrayscaleAlpha16\n   - Type 5: CMYK 32-bit (16x8 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeCmyk32\n   - Type 6: CMYKA 40-bit (16x8 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeCmyka40\n   - Type 8: YCCK 32-bit (16x16 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeYcck32\n   - Type 0xB: YCbCr->RGB 24-bit (16x16 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeYcbcrRgb24\n   - Type 0xD: YCbCr->RGBA 32-bit (8x8 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeYcbcrRgba32\n   - Type 0xE: YCbCr->BGRA 32-bit (8x8 blocks) -> g_pfnDecodeYcbcrBgra32\n4. For each colorspace, call FUN_60002700 to calculate clipping, then dispatch to decoder\n5. If type 0 or unhandled, check subsampling flags at offsets 0x6c and 0x68:\n   - Both set: ProcessSubsampledImagePlanes (FUN_600028b0)\n   - Only 0x68 set: FUN_60002920\n   - Only 0x6c set with context[0x4de0]: ProcessSubsampledImagePlanes\n   - Only 0x6c set without context[0x4de0]: ProcessImagePlanes\n   - Neither set: ProcessImagePlaneBlocks\n\nParameters:\n  pImageContext - Image decoder context structure with dimensions, offsets, pixel data\n  pOutputInfo   - Output buffer descriptor with row offset at +0x2c\n  pPlaneData    - Plane/sampling configuration with colorspace type at +0x18\n  nSrcX         - Source X coordinate for processing region\n  dwSrcY        - Source Y coordinate for processing region\n\nReturns:\n  void - Output written through decoder function pointer callbacks\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x74   - Fast-path flag offset in pPlaneData\n  0x4de0 - Subsampling context flag offset\n  0x18   - Colorspace type offset in pPlaneData\n  0x6c   - Vertical subsampling flag offset\n  0x68   - Horizontal subsampling flag offset\n  0x4834 - Pixel buffer pointer offset\n\nColorspace Block Sizes:\n  8x8   - Grayscale, YCbCr->RGBA, YCbCr->BGRA\n  16x8  - CMYK, CMYKA\n  16x16 - RGB, RGBA, YCCK, YCbCr->RGB",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
