      "name": "ConvertYCbCrToRgb",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYCbCrToRgb(int param_1, int param_2, int param_3, int param_4)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YCbCr color space pixels to RGB format after image plane processing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate format type at context+0x34 (accepts types 1, 2, or 5)\n2. Call FUN_60002700 to calculate clipping region and output buffer offset\n3. If clipping result is non-zero (out of bounds), exit early\n4. Check plane count at context+0x30:\n   - If plane count == 3: Process as 3-byte RGB stride (Y, Cb, Cr interleaved)\n   - Otherwise: Process as per-plane pixel layout\n5. For each row from dwClipY to nSrcX:\n   a. For each column in 3-byte stride:\n      - Read Y (byte 0), Cb (byte 1), Cr (byte 2) from source\n      - Apply YCbCr to RGB conversion using fixed-point coefficients:\n        * R = Y + 1.402 * (Cr - 128)  [coeff 0xb2f5 = 45813]\n        * G = Y - 0.344 * (Cb - 128) - 0.714 * (Cr - 128)  [coeff 0x87f6 = 34806]\n        * B = Y + 1.772 * (Cb - 128)  [coeff 0x1daf = shifted blue]\n      - Clamp each channel to [0, 255] range\n      - Write RGB bytes based on format type (2 = BGR order, else RGB order)\n   b. Advance column by 3 bytes\n6. Repeat until all rows processed\n\nParameters:\n  pImageContext - Pointer to JPEG decoder context structure containing format info\n  pOutputInfo   - Pointer to output buffer information (offset 0x2c = pixel data)\n  nSrcX         - Source X coordinate / height limit for processing\n  dwSrcY        - Source Y coordinate / row limit for processing\n\nReturns:\n  void - Modifies output buffer in place with converted RGB pixels\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xb2f5 (45813) - Fixed-point coefficient for Cr to R conversion (1.402 * 256 * 128)\n  0x87f6 (34806) - Fixed-point coefficient for Cb/Cr to G conversion\n  0x1daf         - Blue channel coefficient (shifted)\n  0xff (255)     - Maximum channel value for clamping\n\nStructure Layout (pImageContext):\n  Offset  Size  Field          Description\n  0x0020  4     dwSrcWidth     Source image width\n  0x0024  4     dwSrcHeight    Source image height\n  0x0028  4     dwSrcOffset    Source data offset\n  0x0030  4     dwPlaneCount   Number of color planes (3 for YCbCr)\n  0x0034  4     dwFormatType   Format type (1=YCbCr, 2=BGR, 5=RGB)\n  0x003C  4     dwRowStride    Row stride in bytes\n  0x0058  4     dwSubFormat    Sub-format flags (6=inverted)\n  0x37B8  4     dwScaledWidth  Scaled width * 8\n  0x37BC  4     dwScaledHeight Scaled height * 8",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
