      "name": "ProcessHorizontalMipmapWithColorConvert",
      "signature": "undefined ProcessHorizontalMipmapWithColorConvert(int param_1, int param_2, int param_3, int param_4, uint param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Processes horizontal-only mipmap data with YCbCr to RGB color conversion.\n\nThis is a specialized dispatch path called when horizontal flag (offset 0x68) is set\nbut vertical flag (offset 0x6c) is NOT set in the texture info structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ProcessMipmapPixelTransfer with nUnused=0 to copy scaled pixel data\n2. Call ConvertYCbCrToRGB to convert color space from YCbCr to RGB\n\nParameters:\n  pTextureInfo  - JpegImageContext* containing texture format and source data\n  pSurfaceData  - IJL_SurfaceData* target surface with output buffer\n  nDestX        - Destination X coordinate for clipping calculation\n  nDestY        - Destination Y coordinate for clipping calculation\n  dwScaleFactor - Scale factor for block dimensions\n\nReturns:\n  void - Results written directly to destination surface buffer\n\nCalled By:\n  DispatchMipmapProcessing - When horizontal flag set, vertical flag unset\n\nCalls:\n  ProcessMipmapPixelTransfer - Copies scaled pixel data to destination\n  ConvertYCbCrToRGB - Converts YCbCr color space to RGB format",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:1a74cd0252a4dee21412fed2fdcf6e92ed6fd7e7ec415e072594e633d5dfd3f1",
