      "name": "ProcessDctBlockNonInterleaved",
      "signature": "undefined ProcessDctBlockNonInterleaved(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "ProcessDctBlockNonInterleaved - Process DCT coefficients for non-interleaved JPEG component\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x103c bytes of stack space for DCT coefficient buffer\n2. Calculate horizontal/vertical MCU dimensions from image context (offsets 0x37b8, 0x37bc)\n3. Compute stride values based on component sampling factors\n4. Handle edge cases for last column/row (partial MCU blocks)\n5. For each component block in the scan:\n   a. Check component type at offset 0x34 and subsampling at 0x58\n   b. Special handling for type 4/subsampling 3 (4:2:0 chroma)\n   c. Extract samples from source into working buffer (word expansion)\n   d. Pad partial rows with edge pixel replication\n6. For each output block:\n   a. Compute DCT coefficient sum over the subsampling region\n   b. Apply rounding bias (0x80) and normalize by block area\n   c. Store averaged coefficient to output\n\nParameters:\n  pImageCtx     - Pointer to JpegImageContext structure containing decoding state\n  pOutputBuf    - Pointer to JpegOutputBuffer structure (coefficient storage at +0x2c)\n  nComponentIdx - Component index for processing (0=Y, 1=Cb, 2=Cr)\n  nColIdx       - Horizontal block index in MCU grid\n  nRowIdx       - Vertical block index in MCU grid\n\nReturns:\n  void - Results stored in pOutputBuf->dwOutputOffset\n\nStructure Layout (JpegImageContext):\n  Offset  Size  Field               Description\n  0x20    4     pDctBaseAddr        Base address of DCT data\n  0x24    4     dwTotalSamples      Total samples in component\n  0x28    4     dwAbsHeight         Absolute height value\n  0x30    4     dwSrcStride         Source buffer stride\n  0x34    4     dwComponentType     Component type (2=special, 4=chroma)\n  0x3c    4     dwBlockStride       Block stride multiplier\n  0x54    4     dwNumBlocks         Number of blocks to process\n  0x58    4     dwSubsampling       Subsampling factor (1=4:4:4, 3=4:2:0)\n  0x78    4     dwMaxColIdx         Maximum column index\n  0x7c    4     dwMaxRowIdx         Maximum row index\n  0x37b8  4     dwMcuWidth          MCU width in samples\n  0x37bc  4     dwMcuHeight         MCU height in samples\n  0x4834  4     pComponentData      Component-specific data pointer\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x103c  - Stack allocation for coefficient buffer (16-byte aligned)\n  0x80    - DC level shift (128) for coefficient normalization\n  0x20    - Block size offset (32 bytes = 16 words)\n  0x8     - 8-pixel block dimension",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
