      "name": "PrepareSampleBlockForDct",
      "signature": "undefined PrepareSampleBlockForDct(uint param_1, uint param_2, int param_3, int param_4)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Prepares an 8x8 sample block for DCT processing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Determine effective block width from MCU row position\n2. Determine effective block height from MCU column position\n3. For each component in the MCU:\n   a. Read source bytes and convert to signed coefficients\n   b. If width < 8, replicate rightmost column (edge extension)\n   c. If height < 8, replicate bottom row (edge extension)\n4. Advance coefficient buffer by 0x80 bytes per block\n\nParameters:\npCompInfo - JpegImageContext pointer with image metadata\npDestInfo - JpegOutputBuffer pointer for output tracking\nnMcuRow - Current MCU row index (0-based)\nnMcuCol - Current MCU column index (0-based)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Writes signed 16-bit coefficients to buffer at pCompInfo+0x4834\n\nStructure offsets in pCompInfo:\n0x20: pImageData, 0x24: dwImageWidth, 0x28: dwImageHeight\n0x30: nBytesPerPixel, 0x34: nColorSpace (2=YCbCr, 4=CMYK)\n0x3C: nBytesPerRow, 0x54: nComponentsPerMcu\n0x78: nMcuRowsTotal, 0x7C: nMcuColsTotal, 0x4834: pCoeffBuffer\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x80 - Center offset for unsigned-to-signed (128)\n8 - Standard DCT block dimension\n0x80 - Block buffer size in bytes (8x8 shorts)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:95e9b9343af68bf65dd718922b2c028531808b33a3efa322024116d5cd7cbc3d",
