      "name": "ConvertYCbCrToRgb565Mmx",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYCbCrToRgb565Mmx(undefined8 * param_1, ulonglong * param_2, int param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YCbCr color space data to RGB565 format using MMX SIMD instructions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pointers: Cb data at input+0x80, Cr data at input+0x100, Y data at input\n2. Loop 8 iterations (processes 8 rows of 16 pixels each):\n   a. Load and left-shift Cb/Cr values by 4 bits for 12.4 fixed-point precision\n   b. Calculate color contributions using coefficient lookup tables:\n      - Blue contribution from Cb channel\n      - Red contribution from Cr channel  \n      - Green contribution from combined Cb and Cr\n   c. Apply bias values to center chroma around zero\n   d. Calculate final RGB: R = Y + Cr_adj, G = Y - combined, B = Y + Cb_adj\n   e. Clamp RGB values to 0-255 range using PACKUSWB (saturating pack)\n   f. Pack 8-bit RGB into RGB565: 5 bits red, 6 bits green, 5 bits blue\n   g. Interleave and store packed RGB565 pixels to output buffer (24 bytes/row)\n   h. Advance output pointer by stride for next row\n\nParameters:\n   pYCbCrData - Pointer to YCbCr planar data buffer:\n                Y plane at offset +0x00 (128 bytes, 8 rows x 16 pixels)\n                Cb plane at offset +0x80 (128 bytes, 8 rows x 16 pixels)  \n                Cr plane at offset +0x100 (128 bytes, 8 rows x 16 pixels)\n   pRgb565Output - Pointer to output buffer for RGB565 packed pixels\n   nOutputStride - Byte stride between output rows (typically 32 for 16 pixels)\n\nReturns:\n   void\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n   0x80 (128) - Byte offset to Cb plane from Y plane base\n   0x100 (256) - Byte offset to Cr plane from Y plane base\n   0x10 (16) - Bytes per iteration increment (16 bytes = 8 packed samples)\n   4 - Left shift for 12.4 fixed-point precision\n   12 (0xC) - Right shift to convert from fixed-point back to integer\n   7 - Initial loop counter (8 iterations: 7 down to 0 inclusive)\n\nGlobal Coefficient Tables:\n   g_qwCbToGreenCoeff (0x60025148) - Cb to green conversion multiplier\n   g_qwCrToRedCoeff (0x60025140) - Cr to red conversion multiplier  \n   g_qwGreenCalcCoeff (0x60025150) - Combined green calculation coefficient\n   g_qwCbToGreenBias (0x60025160) - Bias for Cb to green conversion\n   g_qwCrToRedBias (0x60025158) - Bias for Cr to red conversion\n   g_qwRoundingConst (0x60025168) - Rounding constant for fixed-point math\n   g_qwRgb565PackMask (0x60025190) - Mask for RGB565 bit packing\n   g_qwRgb565MaskBits0-3 - Interleave masks for RGB565 output assembly\n\nRegister Usage (MMX):\n   MM0-MM2 - Cr channel processing and intermediate results\n   MM3-MM4 - Cb channel processing  \n   MM5-MM7 - Coefficient loading, green calculation, packing\n\nDecompiler Note:\n   The decompiled code shows many SSA temporaries (sVar*, uVar*) due to MMX\n   packed SIMD operations. These are compiler-generated intermediates for\n   parallel 4-pixel processing and cannot be renamed. Key semantic mappings:\n   - uVar17,uVar24 - Green channel calculation results\n   - uVar18,uVar30,uVar39,uVar41 - Cb/Cr coefficient products\n   - sVar8-sVar36 - Individual pixel color components (Y, R, G, B values)\n   - uVar43,uVar38 - Packed RGB565 intermediate results",
