      "name": "CalculateRectIntersection",
      "signature": "undefined CalculateRectIntersection(int * param_1, int * param_2, int * param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Calculates the intersection of two rectangles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if rectangles overlap by comparing edges (left vs right, top vs bottom)\n2. If no overlap detected, copy empty rectangle from g_anDecodeValidationThresholds\n3. If overlap exists, compute intersection bounds:\n   - Result left = max(RectA.left, RectB.left)\n   - Result top = max(RectA.top, RectB.top)\n   - Result right = min(RectA.right, RectB.right)\n   - Result bottom = min(RectA.bottom, RectB.bottom)\n4. Store computed intersection in output rectangle\n\nParameters:\n  pOutRect - Output rectangle to receive the intersection result\n  pRectA - First input rectangle\n  pRectB - Second input rectangle\n\nReturns:\n  void - Result stored in pOutRect\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Non-overlapping rectangles: Returns empty rect (all zeros from global)\n\nStructure Layout (Rect):\n  Offset  Size  Field     Type  Description\n  0x00    4     nLeft     int   Left edge X coordinate\n  0x04    4     nTop      int   Top edge Y coordinate\n  0x08    4     nRight    int   Right edge X coordinate\n  0x0C    4     nBottom   int   Bottom edge Y coordinate",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:496708d6a999d894f1e5508a54ce4d52273aed28bda3106adeface80d36be434",
