      "name": "CompareRectEquals",
      "signature": "uint CompareRectEquals(int * param_1, int * param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Compares two Rect structures for exact equality.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compare left fields (offset 0x0)\n2. Compare right fields (offset 0x8)\n3. Compare top fields (offset 0x4)\n4. Compare bottom fields (offset 0xC)\n5. Return TRUE if all four fields match, FALSE otherwise\n\nParameters:\n  pRect1 - Pointer to first Rect structure\n  pRect2 - Pointer to second Rect structure\n\nReturns:\n  TRUE (1) - Rectangles are identical\n  FALSE (0) - Rectangles differ in at least one field\n\nStructure Layout (Rect - 16 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field   Type  Description\n  0x00    4     left    int   Left edge X coordinate\n  0x04    4     top     int   Top edge Y coordinate\n  0x08    4     right   int   Right edge X coordinate\n  0x0C    4     bottom  int   Bottom edge Y coordinate\n\nCalled By:\n  TransformRectByOffset - Uses to check if rect changed after transform",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:f80e17eeb76d7d31b773d6e182e25e4cccdc8b0c9f07c546f195d00f3dac77ee",
