      "name": "ConvertYCbCr411BlockToRgb24",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYCbCr411BlockToRgb24(int param_1, short * param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int * param_5, int param_6)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts a YCbCr 4:1:1 subsampled block to RGB24 format with clipping support.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute output row offset from clip rectangle and stride\n2. For each 4x4 chroma block (8 iterations total):\n   a. Read Cr value and compute Red delta: (Cr * 0x167 - 0xb2f5) >> 8\n   b. Read Cb value and compute Green delta: (Cr * 0xb7 - 0x87f6 + Cb * 0x58) >> 8\n   c. Compute Blue delta: (Cb * 0x1c6 - 0xe251) >> 8\n   d. Store deltas in lookup tables (32 entries each)\n3. For each row in clip rectangle (pnClipRect[1] to pnClipRect[3]):\n   a. For each column in clip rectangle (pnClipRect[0] to pnClipRect[2]):\n      i. Compute chroma index: col/2 + row\n      ii. Read Y luminance value\n      iii. Compute R = clamp(Y + RedDelta[chromaIndex], 0, 255)\n      iv. Compute G = clamp(Y - GreenDelta[chromaIndex], 0, 255)\n      v. Compute B = clamp(Y + BlueDelta[chromaIndex], 0, 255)\n      vi. Write RGB triplet to output buffer\n4. Advance output pointer by stride for each row\n\nParameters:\n  pnYCoefficients - Pointer to Y (luminance) coefficient array (short*)\n  pnCbCoefficients - Pointer to Cb (blue chroma) coefficient array (short*)\n  pnCrCoefficients - Pointer to Cr (red chroma) coefficient array (short*)\n  pbRgbOutput - Destination buffer for RGB24 pixel data (byte*)\n  pnClipRect - Clipping rectangle [xMin, yMin, xMax, yMax] (int*)\n  nOutputStride - Bytes per row in output buffer (int)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x167 (359) - Cr to Red coefficient (1.402 * 256)\n  0xb7 (183) - Cr to Green coefficient (0.714 * 256)\n  0x58 (88) - Cb to Green coefficient (0.344 * 256)\n  0x1c6 (454) - Cb to Blue coefficient (1.772 * 256)\n  0xb2f5 (-45813) - Red bias for 128-centered Cr\n  0x87f6 (-34806) - Green bias for combined Cr/Cb\n  0xe251 (-57937) - Blue bias for 128-centered Cb\n  0x40 (64) - Total lookup table entries (8 blocks * 8 samples)\n  0xff (255) - Maximum byte value for clamping\n\nStructure Layout (pnClipRect):\n  Offset  Size  Field   Type  Description\n  0x00    4     xMin    int   Left column boundary\n  0x04    4     yMin    int   Top row boundary\n  0x08    4     xMax    int   Right column boundary (exclusive)\n  0x0C    4     yMax    int   Bottom row boundary (exclusive)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
