      "name": "ConvertYCbCrToRgbBlock",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYCbCrToRgbBlock(short * param_1, short * param_2, short * param_3, undefined1 * param_4, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts an 8x8 block of YCbCr color data to RGB format using ITU-R BT.601 coefficients.\nThis is a core color space conversion routine used in JPEG/MPEG decoding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize row counter to 8 for processing 8 rows\n2. For each row, load 4 Cb and 4 Cr chroma samples (4:2:2 subsampling)\n3. Compute color offsets using fixed-point BT.601 coefficients:\n   - Red offset = Cr * 359 - 45813 (1.402 coefficient)\n   - Green offset = Cr * 183 + Cb * 88 - 34806 (0.714 + 0.344)\n   - Blue offset = Cb * 454 - 57937 (1.772 coefficient)\n4. Right-shift by 8 to convert from fixed-point to integer\n5. Load 8 Y (luma) samples for the row\n6. For each of 8 pixels: add Y to offsets, clamp to [0,255], store RGB\n7. Advance output pointer by stride for next row\n8. Decrement row counter and repeat until all 8 rows complete\n\nParameters:\n  pnYData - Pointer to 64-element array of Y (luma) values (8x8 block)\n  pnCbData - Pointer to 32-element array of Cb (blue-diff chroma) values\n  pnCrData - Pointer to 32-element array of Cr (red-diff chroma) values\n  pbRgbOutput - Destination buffer for RGB output (24 bytes per row)\n  nOutputStride - Bytes between output rows (image width * 3)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Output written directly to pbRgbOutput buffer\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x167 (359) = 1.402 * 256 (Cr to R, ITU-R BT.601)\n  0xB7 (183) = 0.714 * 256 (Cr to G)\n  0x58 (88) = 0.344 * 256 (Cb to G)\n  0x1C6 (454) = 1.772 * 256 (Cb to B)\n  0xB2F5 = 128 * 1.402 * 256 (red bias)\n  0x87F6 = 128 * 1.058 * 256 (green bias)\n  0xE251 = 128 * 1.772 * 256 (blue bias)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Output clamped to [0,255] to prevent byte overflow\n  Uses 4:2:2 chroma subsampling (4 chroma samples per 8 luma)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:351fafdeaae41eb79471e79a225971d2d41f135717c886493e3023f91add873c",
