      "name": "ConvertYCbCrBlockToRGBA",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYCbCrBlockToRGBA(int param_1, short * param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int * param_5, int param_6)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YCbCr color space data to RGBA pixel format for JPEG decompression.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute destination row offset using bounds y-coordinate and stride\n2. Process 8x4 blocks of chroma data (Cb and Cr components) through color conversion\n   - For each 4x4 block iteration, calculate R, G, B delta values using fixed-point math\n   - Store deltas in stack arrays asStack_60 (R), asStack_40 (G), asStack_20 (B)\n3. Iterate over rows from pBounds->y to pBounds->height\n4. For each row, iterate columns from pBounds->x to pBounds->width\n   - Look up chroma deltas using half-resolution (4:2:0 subsampling)\n   - Combine luma (Y) with R delta, clamp to [0, 255], write to output\n   - Combine luma with G delta (subtract), clamp, write to output\n   - Combine luma with B delta, clamp, write to output\n   - Write alpha = 0xFF (fully opaque)\n5. Advance to next destination row using stride\n\nParameters:\n  pnLumaData    - Pointer to 8x8 block of luma (Y) samples as shorts\n  pnChromaCb    - Pointer to 4x4 block of Cb chroma samples as shorts\n  pnChromaCr    - Pointer to 4x4 block of Cr chroma samples as shorts\n  nDestOffset   - Base offset into destination RGBA buffer\n  pBounds       - Rect* defining output region [x, y, width, height]\n  nDestStride   - Bytes per row in destination buffer\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x167 (359)   - Cr to R coefficient: 1.402 * 256\n  0xB7 (183)    - Cr to G coefficient: 0.714 * 256\n  0x58 (88)     - Cb to G coefficient: 0.344 * 256\n  0x1C6 (454)   - Cb to B coefficient: 1.772 * 256\n  0xB2F5        - R channel bias for fixed-point conversion\n  0x87F6        - G channel bias for fixed-point conversion\n  0xE251        - B channel bias for fixed-point conversion\n  0xFF (255)    - Clamp maximum / alpha value\n\nStructure Layout (Rect at pBounds):\n  Offset | Size | Field  | Type | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | x      | int  | Left column start\n  0x04   | 4    | y      | int  | Top row start  \n  0x08   | 4    | width  | int  | Right column limit (exclusive)\n  0x0C   | 4    | height | int  | Bottom row limit (exclusive)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
