      "name": "ConvertYCbCrBlockToRgbaWithBounds",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertYCbCrBlockToRgbaWithBounds(int param_1, short * param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int param_5, int * param_6, int param_7)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts YCbCr color block to RGBA32 format with bounds clipping.\n\nHandles partial blocks by applying clipping rectangle to limit pixel output.\nUses fixed-point YCbCr to RGB color space conversion coefficients with\nbounds checking to prevent out-of-range color values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate output base address from bounds and pitch parameters\n2. Pre-compute RGB channel offsets from chroma (Cb/Cr) samples:\n   - Red offset = Cr * 0x167 (1.402) - 0xB2F5 >> 8\n   - Green offset = Cr * 0xB7 + Cb * 0x58 - 0x87F6 >> 8 (approx -0.714 * Cr - 0.344 * Cb)\n   - Blue offset = Cb * 0x1C6 (1.772) - 0xE251 >> 8\n3. Loop through bounded pixel region:\n   a. Read Y (luma) sample from input array\n   b. Compute R = clamp(Y + RedOffset, 0, 255)\n   c. Compute G = clamp(Y - GreenOffset, 0, 255)\n   d. Compute B = clamp(Y + BlueOffset, 0, 255)\n   e. Copy A (alpha) from source or set to 0xFF\n   f. Write RGBA pixel to output\n4. Advance to next row using stride, respecting bounds\n\nParameters:\n- pnChromaSamples: Pointer to interleaved Cb/Cr chroma sample array (16-bit signed)\n- pnLumaSamples: Pointer to Y (luma) sample array (16-bit signed)\n- nLumaStride: Byte stride between luma sample rows\n- pbRgbaOutput: Destination buffer for RGBA32 pixels (4 bytes per pixel)\n- nOutputStride: Byte stride between output rows\n- pnBounds: Clipping rectangle [xMin, yMin, xMax, yMax] or [left, top, right, bottom]\n- nRowPitch: Row pitch for alpha channel source\n\nReturns:\n- void: Modifies pbRgbaOutput buffer in-place\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x167 (359): Fixed-point 1.402 for Cr-to-R conversion\n- 0xB7 (183): Fixed-point 0.714 for Cr-to-G component\n- 0x58 (88): Fixed-point 0.344 for Cb-to-G component\n- 0x1C6 (454): Fixed-point 1.772 for Cb-to-B conversion\n- 0xB2F5 (45813): Red channel centering offset\n- 0x780A (30730): Offset constant for green channel\n- 0x1DAF (7599): Offset constant for blue channel\n- 0xE251 (57937): Blue channel centering offset\n- 0xFF (255): Max valid RGB channel value / fully opaque alpha",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
