      "name": "ConvertPartialYcbcrBlockToRgba",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertPartialYcbcrBlockToRgba(int param_1, int param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int * param_5, int param_6)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts a partial YCbCr block to RGBA format by copying Y, Cb, Cr components and setting alpha to 0xFF.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate starting row offset from pYcbcrBlock stride and destination stride\n2. Loop through rows from pYcbcrBlock[1] to pYcbcrBlock[3] (vertical bounds)\n3. For each row, loop through columns from pYcbcrBlock[0] to pYcbcrBlock[2] (horizontal bounds)\n4. Copy Y component from source Y plane to destination R channel\n5. Copy Cb component from Cb plane to destination G channel\n6. Copy Cr component from Cr plane to destination B channel\n7. Set alpha channel to 0xFF (fully opaque)\n8. Advance pointers and continue until block complete\n\nParameters:\n    pYcbcrBlock - Pointer to block descriptor containing bounds [xStart, yStart, xEnd, yEnd]\n    pbDestRgba - Pointer to destination RGBA buffer\n    pbCbPlane - Pointer to source Cb (chrominance blue) plane\n    pbCrPlane - Pointer to source Cr (chrominance red) plane  \n    pBlockInfo - Pointer to block info structure with dimensions at offsets 0x8 and 0xC\n    nDestStride - Stride (bytes per row) of destination RGBA buffer\n\nReturns:\n    void\n\nStructure Layout (pYcbcrBlock):\n    Offset  Size  Field       Description\n    0x00    4     xStart      Starting X coordinate\n    0x04    4     yStart      Starting Y coordinate (row stride multiplier)\n    0x08    4     xEnd        Ending X coordinate (column bound)\n    0x0C    4     yEnd        Ending Y coordinate (row bound)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n    - Early exit if yStart >= yEnd (no rows to process)\n    - Early exit if xStart >= xEnd (no columns to process)\n    - Alpha always set to 0xFF regardless of source data",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:e53d283a30bd350cc0f26887cf13b88316b4e3efe829b2fc4fd440bdf3632321",
