      "name": "ConvertRgbToYCbCrBlock",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertRgbToYCbCrBlock(undefined2 * param_1, undefined2 * param_2, undefined2 * param_3, byte * param_4, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts interleaved RGB pixel data to separate Y, Cb, Cr color planes using ITU-R BT.601 coefficients.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize block counter to 4 (processes 4 blocks of 8 pixels each = 32 pixels total)\n2. For each block iteration:\n   a. Process first row of 8 RGB triplets from pbRgbInput\n   b. Compute Y luma values using weighted RGB sum: Y = 0.299*R + 0.587*G + 0.114*B\n   c. Compute Cb chrominance: Cb = 128 + 0.5*(B-Y) using integer approximation\n   d. Compute Cr chrominance: Cr = 128 + 0.5*(R-Y) using integer approximation\n   e. Process second row of 8 RGB triplets at pbRgbInput + nRowStride\n   f. Accumulate horizontal sums for chroma subsampling preparation\n   g. Store 8 Y values per row (16 total), 8 Cb values, 8 Cr values per block\n   h. Advance input pointer by 2*nRowStride (two rows per block)\n   i. Advance output pointers by 16 (8 samples per row * 2 rows)\n3. Apply centering offset (-128*256 = 0xFFFF8080) and scale by SAR 8\n\nParameters:\n  pnYOutput - Pointer to Y (luma) output buffer, receives 16 samples per block (short)\n  pnCbOutput - Pointer to Cb (blue-difference chroma) output buffer (short)\n  pnCrOutput - Pointer to Cr (red-difference chroma) output buffer (short)\n  pbRgbInput - Pointer to interleaved RGB24 input data (3 bytes per pixel)\n  nRowStride - Byte stride between RGB input rows\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  77 (0x4D)  - Y coefficient for blue:  0.114 * 256 * 3 (scaled LEA)\n  150 (0x96) - Y coefficient for green: 0.587 * 256\n  29 (0x1D)  - Y coefficient for red:   0.299 * 256 (via LEA x*9*2*4+x = 77)\n  85 (0x55)  - Cb coefficient\n  43 (0x2B)  - Cb coefficient  \n  107 (0x6B) - Cr coefficient\n  21 (0x15)  - Cr coefficient\n  0xFFFF8080 - Offset for 8-bit centering (-128 * 256 = -32768, wrapped)\n\nLEA Multiplication Sequences:\n  x + x*8 = 9x, 9x*2 + x = 19x, 19x*4 + x = 77x (red Y coefficient)\n  x*8 - x = 7x, 7x*4 + x = 29x (blue Y coefficient approximation)\n  x + x*2 = 3x, 3x*5 = 15x, 15x*5 = 75x, 75x*2 = 150x (green Y coefficient)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:a8669ef299b23c7a58ce7c29bebeb3b5c57d00c387cc50f61ec2eec430d9214f",
