      "name": "ConvertRgbBlockToYCbCr",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertRgbBlockToYCbCr(int param_1, int param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts RGB image data to YCbCr color space for JPEG encoding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Process each row of RGB input pixels up to nHeight rows\n2. For each pixel, extract R, G, B bytes from interleaved RGB24 data\n3. Convert RGB to YCbCr using ITU-R BT.601 coefficients:\n   Y  = 0.299*R + 0.587*G + 0.114*B (stored at offset -0x80)\n   Cb = 0.5 - 0.169*R - 0.331*G + 0.5*B (stored at offset 0)\n   Cr = 0.5 + 0.5*R - 0.419*G - 0.081*B (stored at offset +0x80)\n4. Pad incomplete rows (width < 16) by replicating last valid sample\n5. Pad incomplete columns (height < 8) by replicating last valid row\n6. Downsample Y component 2:1 horizontally for 4:2:0 chroma subsampling\n\nParameters:\n  nStride - Row stride in bytes between RGB scan lines\n  pnOutputYCbCr - Output buffer for interleaved YCbCr MCU blocks (256 bytes Y + Cb + Cr)\n  nWidth - Width in pixels to process (1-16)\n  nHeight - Height in rows to process (1-8)\n  nRowBytes - Bytes per row in source image\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x96 (150) - R coefficient for Y: 0.587 * 256\n  0x4d (77)  - B coefficient for Y: 0.299 * 256  \n  0x1d (29)  - G coefficient for Y: 0.114 * 256\n  0x55 (85)  - R coefficient for Cb: 0.331 * 256\n  0x2b (43)  - G coefficient for Cb: 0.169 * 256\n  0x6b (107) - R coefficient for Cr: 0.419 * 256\n  0x15 (21)  - G coefficient for Cr: 0.081 * 256\n  0x7f80     - Offset for 8-bit centering (127.5 * 256)\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset    Size    Description\n  -0x300    224     local_300: Y component buffer (112 shorts)\n  -0x220    32      local_220: Padding workspace (16 shorts)\n  -0x200    256     local_200: Cb component buffer (128 shorts)\n  -0x100    256     local_100: Cr component buffer (128 shorts)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:e5e439bf9e064a6076d23a5dafd6b8bc1c5167341c3ce99d91691d8021dd0e04",
