      "name": "ConvertRgbToYCbCr420",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertRgbToYCbCr420(int param_1, int param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts RGB image data to YCbCr 4:2:0 colorspace for JPEG/video compression.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through each row of the input image block (up to nBlockHeight rows)\n2. For each pixel, extract R, G, B components from packed RGB data\n3. Apply ITU-R BT.601 color conversion using fixed-point arithmetic:\n   - Y  = (R*0x1D + G*0x96 + B*0x4D - 0x7F80) >> 8  (Luminance)\n   - Cb = ((R+1)*0x80 - B*0x2B - G*0x55) >> 8       (Blue-difference chroma)\n   - Cr = ((B+1)*0x80 - R*0x15 - G*0x6B) >> 8       (Red-difference chroma)\n4. If block width < 16, pad remaining columns by duplicating edge values\n5. If row count < 8, replicate existing rows to fill 8-row block\n6. Perform 2x2 subsampling on Cb and Cr channels (4:2:0 format)\n7. Write final Y (8x8), Cb (8x8 subsampled), Cr (8x8 subsampled) to output\n\nParameters:\n- nSrcRowStride: Byte stride between source RGB rows\n- pDestYCbCr: Output buffer for YCbCr MCU data (short* layout: Y[-128], Cb[0], Cr[+128])\n- nBlockWidth: Number of source pixels per row (1-16)\n- nBlockHeight: Number of source rows to process (1-8)\n- nSrcPixelStride: Byte stride per source pixel (typically 3 for RGB)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Block width < 16: Edge pixels are replicated to fill 16-column buffer\n- Block height < 8: Rows are replicated to fill 8-row block before subsampling\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x1D (29): R coefficient for Y calculation\n- 0x96 (150): G coefficient for Y calculation  \n- 0x4D (77): B coefficient for Y calculation\n- 0x7F80: Bias offset for Y calculation (32640 = 128 * 255)\n- 0x80 (128): Scale factor for chroma calculations\n- 0x2B (43): B coefficient for Cb\n- 0x55 (85): G coefficient for Cb\n- 0x15 (21): R coefficient for Cr\n- 0x6B (107): G coefficient for Cr\n\nStructure Layout (Stack Buffers):\nOffset    Size    Field       Type        Description\n-0x300    224     anCbBlock   short[112]  Cb chroma working buffer\n-0x220    32      anCrTemp    short[16]   Cr temporary overflow\n-0x200    256     anCbTemp    short[128]  Cb temporary buffer\n-0x100    256     anCrBlock   short[128]  Cr chroma working buffer",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
