      "name": "ConvertRgbToYCbCr420",
      "signature": "undefined ConvertRgbToYCbCr420(int param_1, int param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Converts RGB image data to YCbCr 4:2:0 color space for JPEG encoding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each row up to nSrcHeight:\n   a. For each pixel (nSrcWidth columns):\n      - Extract R, G, B bytes from source, invert from 255\n      - Calculate Y (luminance):  Y = (0x1D*R + 0x96*G + 0x4D*B - 0x7F80) >> 8\n      - Calculate Cb (blue-diff): Cb = ((R+1)*0x80 - 0x2B*B - 0x55*G) >> 8\n      - Calculate Cr (red-diff):  Cr = ((B+1)*0x80 - 0x15*R - 0x6B*G) >> 8\n      - Store alpha channel as (alpha - 0x80)\n   b. If row width < 16, replicate edge pixels to fill MCU block\n2. If total rows < 16, replicate last row to fill MCU block\n3. Perform 4:2:0 chroma subsampling:\n   - Copy Y samples at full resolution to output\n   - Average 2x2 Cb/Cr blocks for quarter-resolution chroma\n   - Use box filter: (TL + TR + BL + BR + 2) >> 2\n\nParameters:\n  nPixelStride - Byte offset between RGB channels (pixel stride)\n  pnOutputBuffer - Destination buffer for YCbCr 4:2:0 data (short pointer)\n  nSrcWidth - Source image width in pixels (columns per row)\n  nSrcHeight - Source image height in pixels (number of rows)\n  nSrcPitch - Source image row stride in bytes\n\nReturns:\n  void - Output written directly to pnOutputBuffer\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x1D (29)  - Red coefficient for Y calculation (BT.601)\n  0x96 (150) - Green coefficient for Y calculation\n  0x4D (77)  - Blue coefficient for Y calculation  \n  0x2B (43)  - Blue coefficient for Cb calculation\n  0x55 (85)  - Green coefficient for Cb calculation\n  0x15 (21)  - Red coefficient for Cr calculation\n  0x6B (107) - Green coefficient for Cr calculation\n  0x80 (128) - Offset for signed chroma representation\n  0x7F80     - Combined offset for Y calculation\n\nStack Layout (0x824 bytes):\n  Offset  Size    Description\n  -0x824  4       pnCbBuffer pointer\n  -0x820  4       nRowIndex counter\n  -0x81C  4       nPixelCount loop counter\n  -0x818  4       nSrcOffset into source\n  -0x800  16      anYBuffer0[8] - Y luminance row 0\n  -0x7F0  464     anYBuffer1[232] - Y luminance buffer\n  -0x620  32      anCbOverflow[16] - Cb overflow buffer\n  -0x600  32      anCbBuffer[16] - Cb chroma buffer\n  -0x5E0  480     anCrBuffer[240] - Cr chroma buffer\n  -0x400  512     anCrBuffer2[256] - Cr extended buffer\n  -0x200  512     anAlphaBuffer[256] - Alpha channel buffer",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
