      "name": "ExpandMcuToCoeffBlocks",
      "signature": "undefined ExpandMcuToCoeffBlocks(int param_1, int param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Expands packed MCU (Minimum Coded Unit) source data into four coefficient blocks.\n\nConverts unsigned byte source data to signed 16-bit coefficients by subtracting 0x80 bias.\nProcesses data in 8x8 block structure typical of JPEG/DCT-based compression.\nWhen fewer than 8 columns are provided, copies existing block data to fill remaining columns.\nWhen fewer than 8 rows are provided, replicates the last valid row to fill remaining rows.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate block base pointer at psCoeffBlocks + 0x80 (offset for first plane)\n2. For each row (up to nRowsToExpand):\n   a. Read 4 interleaved bytes from source per column iteration\n   b. Convert each byte to signed 16-bit: value = byte - 0x80\n   c. Store to 4 planes at offsets 0x00, 0x80, 0x100, 0x180 from base\n   d. If columns < 8, copy existing coefficients to fill remaining columns\n3. If rows < 8, replicate the last processed row to fill remaining rows\n\nParameters:\n  pbSourceData - Pointer to packed source byte data (4 bytes per sample)\n  psCoeffBlocks - Pointer to coefficient block output buffer (4 planes of 8x8 shorts)\n  nColumnsToExpand - Number of source columns to convert (1-8)\n  nRowsToExpand - Number of source rows to convert (1-8)\n  nSourceStride - Byte stride between source rows\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nStructure Layout (coefficient buffer):\n  Offset  Size    Description\n  0x000   0x80    Plane 0 coefficients (8x8 shorts = 128 bytes)\n  0x080   0x80    Plane 1 coefficients\n  0x100   0x80    Plane 2 coefficients\n  0x180   0x80    Plane 3 coefficients\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x80 (128) - Unsigned-to-signed bias for byte conversion\n  0x80, 0x100, 0x180 - Plane offsets in coefficient buffer\n  8 - Block dimension (8x8 blocks standard for DCT)\n\nSSA Variable Reference:\n  psVar1 = psPlane1Base - Base pointer to plane 1 (psCoeffBlocks + 0x80)\n  iVar2 = nCoeffBlocksAddr - Saved psCoeffBlocks address for offset calculations\n  pbVar3 = pbCurrentSourceRow - Pointer to current source data row\n  psVar4 = psCurrentCoeff - Working output coefficient pointer\n  iVar5 = nPlane2Offset - Calculated offset for plane 2 operations\n  pbVar6 = pbSourceByte - Pointer walking through source bytes\n  puVar7 = puPlane2Coeff - Pointer for plane 2 output\n  psVar8/psVar9 = psSourceCoeff - Source pointers for copy operations\n  iVar10 = nFillCounter - Counter for column fill loop\n  iVar11 = nBlockOffset - Calculated offset within coefficient block",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:775a83834b1e9c7ace54d00d32bd08b2994c6b94f8d8bafbdea2d8b40d4d88bf",
