      "name": "ExpandMcu8x8ToCoeffBlocks",
      "signature": "undefined ExpandMcu8x8ToCoeffBlocks(int param_1, short * param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int param_5, int param_6)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Expands an 8x8 MCU (Minimum Coded Unit) into four separate coefficient blocks.\n\nOptimized path for standard 8x8 JPEG/video blocks. Deinterleaves 4 byte-packed\ncolor components (e.g., Y/Cb/Cr/A or RGBX) and converts unsigned bytes (0-255)\nto signed shorts (-128 to +127) for DCT processing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize source pointer to pbSrcMcu + 1 (offset for interleaved byte[0])\n2. Outer loop: iterate 8 rows\n3. Inner loop: iterate 8 columns per row\n   a. Read 4 consecutive bytes from source (4 interleaved components)\n   b. Subtract 0x80 from each to convert unsigned to signed\n   c. Write each component to its respective destination plane\n   d. Advance source by 4 bytes, destination by 2 bytes (sizeof short)\n4. After each row, advance source pointer by nSrcStride\n5. Repeat until all 64 coefficients written to each of 4 planes\n\nParameters:\npnPlane0  - Destination for component 0 (64 shorts, byte offset -1)\npnPlane1  - Destination for component 1 (64 shorts, byte offset 0)\npnPlane2  - Destination for component 2 (64 shorts, byte offset +1)\npnPlane3  - Destination for component 3 (64 shorts, byte offset +2)\npbSrcMcu  - Source interleaved MCU data (32 bytes per row, 8 rows)\nnSrcStride - Bytes between source rows (typically 32 for packed 4-component)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Data written directly to destination planes\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x80 (128)   - Unsigned to signed conversion bias\n8            - Block dimension (8x8 DCT block)\n4            - Bytes per pixel (4 interleaved components)\n\nStructure Layout:\nSource MCU (each row, 32 bytes):\nOffset  Size  Description\n0x00    1     Component 0, pixel 0\n0x01    1     Component 1, pixel 0\n0x02    1     Component 2, pixel 0\n0x03    1     Component 3, pixel 0\n0x04    1     Component 0, pixel 1\n...     ...   (pattern repeats 8 times per row)\n\nDestination planes (each 128 bytes = 64 shorts):\nWritten in row-major order, one short per coefficient",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
