      "name": "DecodeHuffmanSymbol",
      "signature": "int DecodeHuffmanSymbol(uint * param_1, uint * param_2, int param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Decodes a Huffman symbol from the bit buffer using a two-level decode table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check if bit buffer has at least 8 bits available\n  2. If not, call FillBitBuffer to refill; return error on failure\n  3. Extract 8-bit lookup index from bit buffer (peek without consuming)\n  4. Fast path: Look up symbol in fast decode table at offset 0x8\n     - Upper 16 bits = code length, Lower 16 bits = decoded symbol\n     - If code length non-zero: consume bits, store symbol, return success\n  5. Slow path: Code longer than 8 bits, call DecodeHuffmanSymbolSlow\n     - Passes initial code (9) or uses fallback (1) for extended decoding\n\nParameters:\n  pBitBuffer      - Pointer to bit buffer context (uint[4]):\n                    [0-1] qwBits: 64-bit accumulated bit buffer\n                    [3] nBitsRemaining: count of valid bits in buffer\n  pdwSymbol       - Output pointer for decoded Huffman symbol value\n  pHuffmanTable   - Pointer to Huffman decode table:\n                    [+0x8] Fast decode LUT: (codeLen << 16) | symbol\n\nReturns:\n  0        - Success, symbol stored in *pdwSymbol\n  1        - Bit buffer underflow (not enough bits, refill failed gracefully)\n  Non-zero - Error from FillBitBuffer or DecodeHuffmanSymbolSlow\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x8    - Minimum bits needed for fast table lookup\n  0xff   - 8-bit mask for fast lookup index\n  0xffff - Mask for symbol value (lower 16 bits of table entry)\n  0x10   - Shift to extract code length from table entry (16 bits)\n  0x9    - Initial code value for slow path decode\n\nRelated Functions:\n  FillBitBuffer            - Refills bit buffer from input stream\n  DecodeHuffmanSymbolSlow  - Extended decode for codes longer than 8 bits",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:5def7288274c954b01150332690cc3b0c0adfbe7b1d686c9f75db14369d7cfa8",
