      "name": "RefineDctCoefficient",
      "signature": "uint RefineDctCoefficient(uint * param_1, ushort * param_2, byte param_3, short param_4)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Refines a single DCT coefficient during progressive JPEG successive approximation scan.\n\nExtracts one bit from the bit stream and applies a correction value to update\na previously decoded coefficient with additional precision bits.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if bit buffer has at least 1 bit available\n2. If empty, call FillBitBuffer to refill; return error code on failure\n3. Decrement bit count and extract the next bit via 64-bit shift\n4. If extracted bit is set, compute scaled correction: (delta * 2^point_transform + 64) >> 7\n5. OR the correction value into the coefficient (additive refinement)\n6. Return 0 on success\n\nParameters:\n  pBitBuffer       - Pointer to bit buffer structure (uint[4]: data_lo, data_hi, ?, bits_remaining)\n  pwCoefficient    - Pointer to DCT coefficient to refine (in-place update)\n  bPointTransform  - Point transform value (successive approximation bit position, 0-13)\n  nCorrectionDelta - Signed correction delta from Huffman decode (+1 or -1 typically)\n\nReturns:\n  0 on success\n  Non-zero error code if bit buffer refill fails (masked to non-negative)\n\nCalled By:\n  ProcessProgressiveDctScanBlocks - Progressive scan coefficient refinement\n  ProcessMcuBlocksDecode - MCU block refinement pass\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x40 (64) - Rounding constant for 7-bit right shift (0.5 in fixed point)\n  0x1f (31) - Mask for shift amount (prevents undefined behavior)\n  0x7       - 7-bit shift for final scaling\n\nNotes:\n  Used in JPEG progressive mode successive approximation scans where coefficients\n  are refined bit-by-bit across multiple scans. The point transform determines\n  which bit position is being refined in the current scan.",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:9b5bd95a607e0def1d8eef1e2c52b74c465a0faa75f8a7618e415d80a760624a",
