      "name": "EncodeBlockAcCoefficients",
      "signature": "undefined EncodeBlockAcCoefficients(uint * param_1, int param_2, int param_3, short * param_4, short * param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Encodes AC coefficients of a quantized DCT block using Huffman coding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate DC difference between current and previous block\n2. Determine bit length category using g_abBitLengthTable lookup\n3. Write Huffman-coded DC difference symbol and value\n4. For each AC coefficient (1-63) in zigzag scan order:\n   a. If coefficient is zero, increment run-length counter\n   b. If run-length exceeds 15, emit ZRL (0xF0) escape symbols\n   c. Calculate bit length category for non-zero coefficient\n   d. Combine run-length and size into composite symbol (run*16 + size)\n   e. Write Huffman-coded AC symbol and coefficient value\n5. If trailing zeros remain, emit EOB (End of Block) symbol\n\nParameters:\n  pBitStream - Pointer to bit stream output buffer structure\n  nDcHuffTable - DC Huffman table base address for category lookup\n  nAcHuffTable - AC Huffman table base address for run/size lookup\n  pnPreviousDc - Pointer to previous DC value (updated on success)\n  pnQuantizedBlock - 64-element quantized DCT coefficient array\n\nReturns:\n  void - Returns early on write error\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x601 - Bit buffer threshold for optimized vs standard path\n  0x40 (64) - Number of DCT coefficients per block\n  0x10 (16) - Maximum run-length before ZRL escape\n  0xFF (255) - Maximum single-byte coefficient magnitude\n  0x100 (256) - Threshold for extended coefficient encoding\n  0x408 - Offset to Huffman code table in table structure\n  0x8 - Offset to bit count table in table structure\n  0x5E8 - Offset to ZRL (zero run-length) code entry\n  0x3C8 - Offset to ZRL bit count entry\n\nCalled From:\n  InitializeScalarDecodeFunctionTable, InitializeSseDecodeFunctionTable,\n  InitializeSse2DecodeFunctionTable - Function pointer tables for encoding",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
