      "name": "ProcessZigzagDctCoefficients",
      "signature": "undefined ProcessZigzagDctCoefficients(int * param_1, int param_2, uint * param_3)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Processes four DCT coefficients in zigzag scan order for JPEG encoding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Fetch 4 coefficients using zigzag indices from lookup table\n2. Pack coefficients into two 32-bit words (low/high pairs)\n3. Check if all coefficients are zero - if so, call continuation handler\n4. Use MMX SIMD to detect which individual coefficients are zero\n5. If any zeros detected, dispatch to specialized handler via jump table\n6. Otherwise store packed coefficients directly to output buffer\n\nParameters:\n  pnZigzagIndices - Array of 4 zigzag indices [0-63] for DCT coefficient lookup\n  nCoefficientTableBase - Base address of 16-bit DCT coefficient table (word-indexed)\n  pdwOutputBuffer - Output buffer for packed coefficients and run-length data\n                    [0-3] = packed coefficients, [0x40-0x43] = run-length counts\n\nReturns:\n  void - Results stored in pdwOutputBuffer\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - All zeros: Skips storage, calls FUN_60016d58 for run-length increment\n  - Partial zeros: Uses jump table at LAB_600169f1 for sparse encoding\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x10001/0x20002/etc - MMX mask constants for word operations\n  0xffff - Low word mask\n  0x20001/0x80004 - Bit masks for jump table index calculation\n  0x40/0x41/0x42/0x43 - Run-length count offsets in output buffer\n\nStructure Layout (pdwOutputBuffer):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Type   Description\n  0x00    4     dwPackedCoeff0     uint   Packed coefficient pair 0|1\n  0x04    4     dwCoeff1Low        uint   Coefficient 1 low word\n  0x08    4     dwPackedCoeff2     uint   Packed coefficient pair 2|3\n  0x0C    4     dwCoeff3Low        uint   Coefficient 3 low word\n  0x100   4     dwRunCount0        uint   Run-length count for position 0\n  0x104   4     dwRunCount1        uint   Run-length count for position 1\n  0x108   4     dwRunCount2        uint   Run-length count for position 2\n  0x10C   4     dwRunCount3        uint   Run-length count for position 3",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:74240548c706c782b7c1a78799d74c523173dbfd9a93aa237fc5749e9ae50162",
