      "name": "StoreTwoNonZeroCoefficientsAndFinalize",
      "signature": "void StoreTwoNonZeroCoefficientsAndFinalize(int nCoefficient1, int nCoefficient2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Stores two non-zero DCT coefficients and their metadata, then finalizes encoding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read current coefficient buffer end pointer from caller's stack [EBP-0x3C]\n2. Store coefficient index (EBX) at pdwCoeffStorage[0x00]\n3. Store first coefficient value (ECX/nCoefficient1) at pdwCoeffStorage[0x04]\n4. Store second coefficient value (EDX/nCoefficient2) at pdwCoeffStorage[0x100]\n5. Set non-zero flags: pdwCoeffStorage[0x104] = 1, [EBP-0x38] = 1\n6. Advance buffer pointer by 8 bytes (2 coefficient entries)\n7. Jump to FinalizeCoefficientStorageAndComputeRunLengths for epilogue processing\n\nParameters:\n  nCoefficient1 (ECX): First non-zero DCT coefficient value\n  nCoefficient2 (EDX): Second non-zero DCT coefficient value\n  IMPLICIT EBX: Coefficient index/position in DCT block\n  IMPLICIT ESI: Pointer to coefficient storage structure\n  IMPLICIT [EBP-0x3C]: Pointer to coefficient buffer end\n  IMPLICIT [EBP-0x38]: Final encoding state flag\n\nReturns:\n  void - Outputs written to coefficient storage structure\n\nStructure Layout (pdwCoeffStorage):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x000   4     dwCoeffIndex       Coefficient position in DCT block\n  0x004   4     nCoeffValue1       First coefficient value\n  0x100   4     nCoeffValue2       Second coefficient value  \n  0x104   4     dwNonZeroFlag      Non-zero indicator (1 = has values)\n\nNote: This is a specialized entry point jumped to from coefficient encoding\nloops. Uses caller's stack frame for all implicit parameters.",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:8826d782987eb91b8fe4e4c699e264d5c96b1ad0d58030c21e423678c357f546",
