      "name": "StoreSingleCoefficientAndFinalize",
      "signature": "undefined StoreSingleCoefficientAndFinalize(uint param_1, int param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Stores a single DCT coefficient and finalizes the encoding block.\n\nThis is a specialized entry point for the sparse coefficient encoding path when\nexactly one non-zero coefficient remains. Jumped to from thunk at 0x60016a39.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Increment coefficient count at pCoefficientBuffer[0x40]\n2. Store high 16 bits of dwPackedCoeff1 to coefficient slot 1\n3. Set single-coefficient flag at pCoefficientBuffer[0x41] = 1\n4. Store high 16 bits of implicit EBX to coefficient slot 0\n5. Advance buffer pointer by 8 bytes\n6. Clear run-length state\n7. Jump to FinalizeCoefficientStorageAndComputeRunLengths\n\nParameters:\n  dwPackedCoeff1 (ECX): Packed coefficient data, high 16 bits contain value\n  nCoefficientIndex (EDX): Current coefficient index in zigzag order\n  IMPLICIT unaff_EBX: Packed coefficient data for slot 0 (high 16 bits used)\n  IMPLICIT unaff_ESI: Pointer to coefficient storage buffer structure\n  IMPLICIT [EBP-0x3C]: Pointer to current position in coefficient buffer\n  IMPLICIT [EBP-0x38]: Run-length encoding state accumulator\n\nReturns:\n  void - Does not return to caller; jumps to finalization routine\n\nStructure Layout (ESI points to CoefficientBuffer):\n  Offset  Size  Field         Description\n  0x000   4     dwCoeff0      First coefficient value (high 16 bits of EBX)\n  0x004   4     dwCoeff1      Second coefficient value (high 16 bits of ECX)\n  0x100   4     nCoeffCount   Number of coefficients stored (index + 1)\n  0x104   4     fSingleCoeff  Flag indicating single coefficient mode (set to 1)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x10 (16) - Bit shift to extract high 16 bits from packed DWORD\n  0x100 (256) - Offset to coefficient count field (0x40 * 4)\n  0x104 (260) - Offset to single-coefficient flag (0x41 * 4)\n  8 - Buffer pointer increment per coefficient pair stored",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
