      "name": "InitModuleVersionInfo",
      "signature": "BOOL InitModuleVersionInfo(HMODULE param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "BOOL",
      "comment": "Initializes module version information from PE version resource.\n\nExtracts version data from the specified module's embedded version resource\nand stores it in global variables for later access.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get module file path using GetModuleFileNameA\n2. Query version info size using GetFileVersionInfoSizeA\n3. Allocate buffer and retrieve version info using GetFileVersionInfoA\n4. Query VS_FIXEDFILEINFO root block for file version numbers\n5. Extract major.minor.build.revision from dwFileVersionMS/LS\n6. Query ProductVersion and OriginalFileName strings\n7. Format version string as \"[major.minor.build.revision]\"\n8. Store pointers to version strings in global table\n\nParameters:\n  hModule - Handle to module to extract version info from (HMODULE)\n\nReturns:\n  BOOL - TRUE if version info extracted successfully, FALSE on failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns FALSE if module path cannot be retrieved\n  - Returns FALSE if no version resource exists\n  - Returns FALSE if memory allocation fails\n  - Returns FALSE if version queries fail\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_dwVersionMajor   - Major version number (HIWORD of dwFileVersionMS)\n  g_dwVersionMinor   - Minor version number (LOWORD of dwFileVersionMS)\n  g_dwVersionBuild   - Build number (HIWORD of dwFileVersionLS)\n  g_szProductVersion - Product version string buffer\n  g_szOriginalFilename - Original filename string buffer\n  g_szVersionString  - Formatted version \"[x.x.x.x]\" buffer\n  g_pszOriginalFilename - Pointer to g_szOriginalFilename\n  g_pszProductVersion - Pointer to g_szProductVersion\n  g_pszVersionString - Pointer to g_szVersionString\n  g_pszBuildDate     - Pointer to build date string\n  g_pszModuleType    - Pointer to module type \"DLL\"",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:c836175d33359c09f170f3abb3f12528",
