      "name": "NormalizeJpegMarkerCode",
      "signature": "uint NormalizeJpegMarkerCode(uint dwMarkerCode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Normalizes JPEG marker codes by masking APP and extension markers to their category base.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if marker code is in normalization range (0xE0-0xFD)\n2. If in range, mask to category base using AND 0xF0\n3. Return normalized or unchanged marker code\n\nParameters:\n    dwMarkerCode - Raw JPEG marker byte value (0x00-0xFF)\n\nReturns:\n    Normalized marker code:\n    - APP markers (0xE0-0xEF) normalized to 0xE0\n    - Extension markers (0xF0-0xFD) normalized to 0xF0\n    - All other markers returned unchanged\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n    0xE0 = APP0 marker (start of APP range)\n    0xFD = JPG13 marker (end of extension range)\n    0xF0 = Category mask (preserves high nibble)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:4c6c22c4df6396bdd68d13274a36c3d865bdd20200b4902e14a6a9257520f7ed",
