      "name": "ParseJfxxThumbnailData",
      "signature": "undefined4 ParseJfxxThumbnailData(int * param_1, byte * param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Parses JFXX (JFIF Extension) thumbnail data from a JPEG stream.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6001aa60 to initialize stream parsing context\n2. Validate stream length (min 14 bytes, max 0x3000E bytes)\n3. Call ReadBytesFromJpegStream to extract APP0 segment data\n4. Check signature for \"JFXX\\0\" (extension) or \"JFIF\\0\" (standard)\n5. Parse thumbnail type byte at offset 5:\n   - 0x10: JPEG thumbnail (not processed, skip)\n   - 0x11: Palette thumbnail (768-byte RGB palette + indexed pixels)\n   - 0x13: RGB24 thumbnail (raw RGB pixels)\n6. Extract thumbnail width and height from stream\n7. For palette type (0x11):\n   - Allocate 768-byte (0x300) palette buffer via operator_new\n   - Copy palette data from stream\n   - Convert indexed pixels to RGB using palette lookup\n8. For RGB24 type (0x13):\n   - Copy raw RGB pixel data row-by-row\n9. Handle RGB/BGR swap based on pImageCtx->dwComponentType:\n   - Type 1: Keep RGB order\n   - Other: Swap to BGR order\n10. Store thumbnail dimensions in pImageCtx at offset 0x60/0x64\n11. Free temporary allocations via AtoiMbcsWrapper (free wrapper)\n\nParameters:\n  pImageCtx - Pointer to JpegImageContext structure containing:\n              - offset 0x00: JPEG version (0x14=JFIF 1.4, 0x15=JFIF 1.5)\n              - offset 0x20: pDctBaseAddr (output buffer base)\n              - offset 0x34: dwComponentType (1=RGB, other=BGR)\n              - offset 0x3C: dwBlockStride (row stride in bytes)\n              - offset 0x60: dwThumbnailWidth (output)\n              - offset 0x64: dwThumbnailHeight (output)\n              - offset 0x37DC: thumbnail enable flag\n  pbStreamData - Raw JPEG stream data pointer\n\nReturns:\n  0 on success\n  -21 (0xFFFFFFEB) on stream read error\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x4A 0x46 0x58 0x58 0x00 = \"JFXX\\0\" signature\n  0x4A 0x46 0x49 0x46 0x00 = \"JFIF\\0\" signature\n  0x10 = JPEG compressed thumbnail type\n  0x11 = Palette-based thumbnail type\n  0x13 = RGB24 uncompressed thumbnail type\n  0x14/0x15 = JFIF version 1.4/1.5\n  0x300 = 768 bytes = 256 colors * 3 bytes (RGB palette size)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
