      "name": "WriteJfifApp0Marker",
      "signature": "undefined WriteJfifApp0Marker(undefined4 param_1)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Writes the JFIF APP0 marker segment to the JPEG output stream.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize 20-byte marker data buffer on stack\n2. Write APP0 marker prefix (0xE0) to output via FUN_6001b8b0\n3. Write APP0 length field (0x10 = 16 bytes) via FUN_6001b8d0\n4. Build JFIF signature: 'J' (0x4A), 'F' (0x46), 'I' (0x49), 'F' (0x46), null\n5. Write JFIF version 1.1: Major=1, Minor=1\n6. Write density units byte: 0 (aspect ratio only, no physical units)\n7. Write thumbnail dimensions: X=0, Y=0 (no embedded thumbnail)\n8. Flush buffered marker data via FUN_6001b8d0\n9. Call g_pfnDecodeProc1 to output complete 18-byte APP0 segment\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (byte*) - Destination buffer for encoded JPEG stream data\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value; output written directly to buffer via callback\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xE0 - JPEG APP0 marker identifier\n  0x10 - APP0 segment payload length (16 bytes, excludes marker)\n  0x12 - Total APP0 segment size (18 bytes including length field)\n  0x4A,0x46,0x49,0x46,0x00 - \"JFIF\" null-terminated identifier\n  0x01,0x01 - JFIF version 1.1 (major, minor)\n\nJFIF APP0 Marker Layout:\n  Offset  Size  Field           Value\n  0       2     Marker          0xFFE0 (written by caller)\n  2       2     Length          0x0010 (16 bytes)\n  4       5     Identifier      \"JFIF\\0\"\n  9       1     Version Major   0x01\n  10      1     Version Minor   0x01\n  11      1     DensityUnits    0x00 (aspect ratio)\n  12      2     Xdensity        (set elsewhere)\n  14      2     Ydensity        (set elsewhere)\n  16      1     Xthumbnail      0x00\n  17      1     Ythumbnail      0x00",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
