      "name": "CheckRestartIntervalBoundary",
      "signature": "int CheckRestartIntervalBoundary(byte * param_1, uint param_2, int param_3, int param_4, int param_5)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Checks if the current block position falls on a restart interval boundary and processes the restart marker if needed.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if restart interval is enabled (pScanInfo[0x18] != 0)\n2. Calculate absolute block position: (blocks_per_row * nBlockRow) + nBlockColumn + 1\n3. Check if position is divisible by restart interval (modulo check)\n4. Verify position is within total block count bounds\n5. Reset all 4 DC prediction coefficients in scan info (offsets 0x24-0x30)\n6. Clear the accumulated bits counter in bitstream state (offset 0xc)\n7. If marker already pending (bMarkerPending != 0), clear flag and return success\n8. Otherwise call ReadNextJpegMarkerCode to read and validate the restart marker\n\nParameters:\n  pBitstreamState - Bitstream reader state containing bit buffer and marker flags\n  pScanInfo       - Current scan processing state with restart interval and DC predictions\n  nJpegContext    - JPEG decoder context with image dimensions and component info\n  nBlockColumn    - Current MCU block column index (X position)\n  nBlockRow       - Current MCU block row index (Y position)\n\nReturns:\n  0               - No restart boundary, or restart processed successfully\n  Non-zero        - Error code from ReadNextJpegMarkerCode (marker validation failed)\n\nStructure Layout:\n  pScanInfo:\n    +0x18  dwRestartInterval  uint    Restart interval in MCU blocks (0=disabled)\n    +0x24  nDcPred0           int     DC prediction for component 0\n    +0x28  nDcPred1           int     DC prediction for component 1  \n    +0x2c  nDcPred2           int     DC prediction for component 2\n    +0x30  nDcPred3           int     DC prediction for component 3\n\n  pBitstreamState:\n    +0x0c  dwAccumulatedBits  uint    Accumulated bits counter (cleared on restart)\n    +0x30  bMarkerPending     byte    Flag indicating marker already detected\n\n  nJpegContext:\n    +0x78  nBlocksPerRow      int     Number of MCU blocks per row\n    +0x7c  nTotalBlockRows    int     Total number of MCU block rows",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:fb8cec2b742ce42b84bbb4656b3a1d1099f7f403bc49d29ef48ba3a08455a59b",
