      "name": "InitializeMcuRowFromRestartTable",
      "signature": "undefined4 InitializeMcuRowFromRestartTable(int param_1, undefined4 * param_2, int param_3, int * param_4)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes MCU (Minimum Coded Unit) row parameters from the restart marker table.\n\nCopies scan initialization data from the restart marker table entry corresponding to the\ngiven MCU row index. Handles two operating modes based on the decode mode flags:\nseekable mode (file-based) and streaming mode (buffer-based).\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Calculate restart table entry offset: nMcuRowIndex * 0x28 (40 bytes per entry)\n  2. Load restart marker table base pointer from pFrameInfo[0x120C]\n  3. Copy bitstream state fields from restart table entry to pBitStream:\n     - [+0x18] -> pBitStream[0]: Bit buffer contents\n     - [+0x1C] -> pBitStream[1]: Bits remaining in buffer\n     - [+0x20] -> pBitStream[3]: Additional state field\n     - [+0x24] -> pBitStream[0x30]: Byte field (component index)\n  4. Copy DC coefficient predictor values to pScanInfo:\n     - [+0x04] -> pScanInfo[9]: DC predictor for component 0\n     - [+0x08] -> pScanInfo[10]: DC predictor for component 1\n     - [+0x0C] -> pScanInfo[11]: DC predictor for component 2\n     - [+0x10] -> pScanInfo[12]: DC predictor for component 3\n  5. Check decode mode at pFrameInfo[0]:\n     - Seekable modes (2, 6, 0xE, 0x10, 0x12): Seek file and read new buffer\n     - Streaming mode: Calculate buffer offset from current position\n\nParameters:\n  nMcuRowIndex - Zero-based MCU row index to initialize from\n  pBitStream   - Pointer to bitstream context structure (buffer, position, bit state)\n  pScanInfo    - Pointer to scan info array (DC predictors at indices 9-12)\n  pFrameInfo   - Pointer to frame info array (restart table at [0x120C], decode mode at [0])\n\nReturns:\n  0        - Success, bitstream positioned and DC predictors loaded\n  -0x17    - Error: File seek failed (FUN_60018130 returned 0)\n  -0x17    - Error: Buffer fill failed (FUN_60001050 returned non-zero)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x28     - Size of each restart marker table entry (40 bytes)\n  0x120C   - Frame info index for restart marker table pointer (4620 decimal)\n  0x11     - Frame info index for stream base position (17 decimal)\n\nRestart Table Entry Layout (40 bytes per MCU row):\n  Offset   Size   Field\n  0x00     4      File position / stream offset\n  0x04     4      DC predictor component 0\n  0x08     4      DC predictor component 1\n  0x0C     4      DC predictor component 2\n  0x10     4      DC predictor component 3\n  0x18     4      Bit buffer contents\n  0x1C     4      Bits remaining\n  0x20     4      Additional state\n  0x24     1      Component index byte\n\nDecode Mode Values:\n  2, 6, 0xE, 0x10, 0x12 - Seekable file modes (random access)\n  Other                  - Streaming mode (sequential buffer)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
