      "name": "AtoiMbcsWrapper",
      "signature": "int AtoiMbcsWrapper(byte * pbStr)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Wrapper that forwards a MBCS string to AtoiMbcs for integer conversion.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push pbStr parameter onto stack\n2. Call AtoiMbcs to convert string to integer\n3. Return the parsed integer value\n\nParameters:\n- pbStr (byte*): Null-terminated MBCS string to parse\n\nReturns:\n- Parsed integer value from AtoiMbcs\n\nNote: Simple thunk function used by ParseTreasureClassItems for parsing\nnumeric values from treasure class data files.",
