      "name": "GetFpuControlWord",
      "signature": "dword GetFpuControlWord(dword dwSourceFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Convert FPU control flags from one format to another for FPU control register updates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize target flags to 0\n2. Test source flag bit 0 (0x01) - if set, OR target with 0x10 (exception enable bit 4)\n3. Test source flag bit 2 (0x04) - if set, OR target with 0x08 (exception enable bit 3) \n4. Test source flag bit 3 (0x08) - if set, OR target with 0x04 (exception enable bit 2)\n5. Test source flag bit 4 (0x10) - if set, OR target with 0x02 (exception enable bit 1)\n6. Test source flag bit 5 (0x20) - if set, OR target with 0x01 (exception enable bit 0)\n7. Test source flag bit 1 (0x02) - if set, OR target with 0x80000 (special control bit)\n8. Extract precision control bits (bits 10-11, mask 0xc00) from source\n9. Map precision control: 0x400->0x100, 0x800->0x200, 0xc00->0x300\n10. Extract rounding control bits (bits 8-9, mask 0x300) from source\n11. Map rounding control: 0x00->0x20000, 0x200->0x10000, others->no change\n12. Test source flag bit 12 (0x1000) - if set, OR target with 0x40000\n13. Return converted target flags\n\nParameters:\ndwSourceFlags - Input FPU control flags in source format to be converted\n\nReturns:\nConverted FPU control flags in target format for hardware register update\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x01 - Source exception enable bit 0 -> Target bit 4 (0x10)\n0x02 - Source special control bit -> Target bit 19 (0x80000)\n0x04 - Source exception enable bit 2 -> Target bit 3 (0x08)\n0x08 - Source exception enable bit 3 -> Target bit 2 (0x04)\n0x10 - Source exception enable bit 4 -> Target bit 1 (0x02)\n0x20 - Source exception enable bit 5 -> Target bit 0 (0x01)\n0x300 - Rounding control mask (bits 8-9)\n0xc00 - Precision control mask (bits 10-11)\n0x1000 - Source control bit 12 -> Target bit 18 (0x40000)\n0x10000 - Target rounding mode: round towards nearest\n0x20000 - Target rounding mode: round towards zero (truncate)\n0x100, 0x200, 0x300 - Target precision control values\n0x40000 - Target control bit for infinity control\n\nFlag Bits:\nSource Format Bits -> Target Format Bits\nBit 0 (0x01): Exception mask 0 -> Exception enable 4 (0x10)\nBit 1 (0x02): Special control -> Control bit 19 (0x80000)  \nBit 2 (0x04): Exception mask 2 -> Exception enable 3 (0x08)\nBit 3 (0x08): Exception mask 3 -> Exception enable 2 (0x04)\nBit 4 (0x10): Exception mask 4 -> Exception enable 1 (0x02)\nBit 5 (0x20): Exception mask 5 -> Exception enable 0 (0x01)\nBits 8-9 (0x300): Rounding control -> Rounding mode (0x10000/0x20000)\nBits 10-11 (0xc00): Precision control -> Precision mode (0x100/0x200/0x300)\nBit 12 (0x1000): Infinity control -> Control bit 18 (0x40000)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
