      "name": "InitializeStreamBuffer",
      "signature": "void InitializeStreamBuffer(uint * pStreamState, byte * pExternalBuffer, uint dwBufferSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a bitstream buffer state structure for JPEG encoding/decoding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check the internal buffer flag at offset 0x3C (pStreamState[0xf])\n2. If flag is 0 (external buffer mode):\n   a. Set buffer base pointer (offset 0x10) to pExternalBuffer\n   b. Set current position pointer (offset 0x14) to pExternalBuffer\n   c. Set buffer end pointer (offset 0x18) to pExternalBuffer + dwBufferSize\n3. If flag is non-zero (internal buffer mode):\n   a. Set buffer base pointer (offset 0x10) to internal buffer at struct+0x40\n   b. Set buffer end pointer (offset 0x18) to struct+0x1040 (4KB internal buffer)\n4. Reset bit accumulator (offset 0x0) to 0\n5. Reset bit count (offset 0x4) to 0\n6. Set bits-per-byte constant (offset 0xC) to 8\n\nParameters:\n  pStreamState - Pointer to stream state structure (minimum 0x1040 bytes if internal buffer used)\n  pExternalBuffer - Base address of external byte buffer (used only if internal flag is 0)\n  dwBufferSize - Size of external buffer in bytes (used only if internal flag is 0)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset  Size  Field               Description\n  0x00    4     dwBitAccumulator    Accumulated bits for byte assembly\n  0x04    4     dwBitCount          Number of bits currently accumulated\n  0x0C    4     dwBitsPerByte       Constant value 8 (bits per output byte)\n  0x10    4     pBufferBase         Pointer to start of buffer\n  0x14    4     pCurrentPos         Current write/read position\n  0x18    4     pBufferEnd          Pointer to end of buffer\n  0x3C    4     fUseInternalBuffer  Flag: 0=external buffer, non-zero=internal\n  0x40    4096  abInternalBuffer    Internal 4KB buffer (if fUseInternalBuffer set)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "NOP",
