      "comment": "Decodes a 16x16 video block using decode procedure 8.\n\nCRITICAL ISSUE: Function body is broken in Ghidra database.\nBody shows: 60007c00 - 60007c00 (1 byte) but actual code is ~194 bytes.\nRET instruction at approximately 0x60007cc2.\n\nMANUAL FIX REQUIRED:\n1. In Ghidra, select address 0x60007c00\n2. Right-click > Clear Flow and Repair\n3. Press 'D' to disassemble from 0x60007c00 through 0x60007cc2\n4. Press 'F' to recreate function at 0x60007c00\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x50 bytes stack space (SUB ESP, 0x50)\n2. Save registers EBX, EBP, ESI, EDI (PUSH sequence)\n3. Initialize block bounds array: [0, 0, 0x10, 0x10] for 16x16 block\n4. Call FUN_60007b00 to validate decode context\n5. Fast path (if validation passes):\n   a. Call FUN_600080f0 for quadrant 0 (top-left, offset 0x000)\n   b. Call FUN_600080f0 for quadrant 1 (top-right, offset 0x18)\n   c. Call FUN_600080f0 for quadrant 2 (bottom-left, stride*8)\n   d. Call FUN_600080f0 for quadrant 3 (bottom-right, stride*8+0x18)\n6. Slow path (if validation fails):\n   a. For each quadrant (0-3):\n      i.   Call FUN_60007a60 to get decode parameters\n      ii.  Copy parameters to stack locals\n      iii. Call FUN_60007b40 to validate thresholds\n      iv.  If valid, call FUN_60007f20 to process coefficients\n7. Restore stack (ADD ESP, 0x50) and return\n\nParameters:\n  pCoefficients (short*): DCT coefficient buffer (512 shorts for 4 64-coeff blocks)\n  pOutputBuffer (byte*): Destination pixel buffer for decoded output\n  pDecodeContext (int*): Decode state structure pointer with block parameters\n  nStride (int): Row stride in bytes for output buffer\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nStructure Layout (stack frame at 0x50 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field           Type       Description\n  0x10    20    aiBlockBounds   int[5]     [x, y, width, height, temp]\n  0x24    16    aiParams        int[4]     Parameter copy from context\n  0x34    16    aiWorkArray     int[4]     Working array for thresholds\n  0x44    12    Reserved        byte[12]   Stack alignment padding\n\nCalled By:\n  InitializeScalarDecodeFunctionTable (g_pfnDecodeProc8 at 0x60028910)\n  InitializeSseDecodeFunctionTable (g_pfnDecodeProc8 at 0x60028910)\n  InitializeSse2DecodeFunctionTable (g_pfnDecodeProc8 at 0x60028910)\n\nRelated Functions:\n  DecodeVideoBlock16x16Proc9 (0x60008ba0) - Similar structure, variant processing\n  FUN_60007b00 - Context validation function\n  FUN_60007a60 - Get decode parameters\n  FUN_60007b40 - Threshold validation\n  FUN_600080f0 - Fast quadrant decoder\n  FUN_60007f20 - Coefficient processor (slow path)",
