      "comment": "Wrapper that counts validated lock context entities\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls ProcessLockContextEntities with mode 1 (Count Mode)\n2. Discards the returned count (void wrapper)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - The validation count from ProcessLockContextEntities is discarded\n\nWraps:\nProcessLockContextEntities(1) - Count mode that iterates through\ng_ppLockContextTable and returns the number of entities that pass\nvalidation (entities with active flags 0x83 that validate successfully)\n\nUsage Context:\nCalled when the count result is not needed but the side effects of\nprocessing/validating all lock context entities are desired",
